# 🔵 C Programming

> **Building the foundation.**

### Core Concepts

|  # | Topic           | Focus                                    |
| -: | --------------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| 01 | Basics          | Program Structure, Variables, Constants  |
| 02 | Data Types      | Primitive Data Types                     |
| 03 | Input / Output  | `printf()` / `scanf()`                   |
| 04 | Operators       | Arithmetic, Relational, Logical, Bitwise |
| 05 | Control Flow    | `if`, `else`, `switch`                   |
| 06 | Loops           | `for`, `while`, `do-while`               |
| 07 | Nested Loops    | Multi-level Iteration                    |
| 08 | Jump Statements | `break`, `continue`, `goto`              |
| 09 | Functions       | Modular Programming                      |
| 10 | Arrays          | 1D / 2D Arrays                           |
| 11 | Strings         | String Handling                          |
| 12 | Pointers        | Address & Memory                         |
| 13 | Structures      | User Defined Data                        |
| 14 | File Handling   | File Operations                          |
| 15 | Dynamic Memory  | Runtime Memory Management                |

