# 🟣 C++ Programming

> **From procedural programming to OOP.**

### Core Concepts

|  # | Topic              | Focus                     |
| -: | ------------------ | ------------------------- |
| 01 | C++ Basics         | Syntax & Fundamentals     |
| 02 | I/O                | `cin`, `cout`             |
| 03 | Functions          | Function Concepts         |
| 04 | References         | Reference Variables       |
| 05 | Classes            | Class Design              |
| 06 | Objects            | Object Creation           |
| 07 | Constructors       | Object Initialization     |
| 08 | Destructors        | Object Cleanup            |
| 09 | `this` Pointer     | Current Object            |
| 10 | Encapsulation      | Data Hiding               |
| 11 | Abstraction        | Essential Features        |
| 12 | Inheritance        | Code Reusability          |
| 13 | Polymorphism       | Multiple Forms            |
| 14 | Overloading        | Compile-Time Polymorphism |
| 15 | Templates          | Generic Programming       |
| 16 | Exception Handling | Error Management          |
| 17 | STL                | Standard Template Library |

